1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 8=

2
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:18,080
Physician.

3
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:19,120
How is she?

4
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,480
Her pulse seems normal.

5
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:23,600
I'm afraid

6
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,040
she isn't pregnant.

7
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:28,240
Physician,

8
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:29,880
could you

9
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,160
take another careful look?

10
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,240
I've practiced medicine for many years.

11
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,240
I couldn't possibly be mistaken.

12
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:37,080
Judging by her pulse,

13
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,080
she really isn't pregnant.

14
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,320
I paid a fortune

15
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,460
to bring you into this house.

16
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:52,280
I feed you, give you drink,

17
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,600
and provide for you,

18
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:57,240
yet you can't even give me a child!

19
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,200
Say something!

20
00:01:58,720 --> 00:01:59,800
Don't be angry.

21
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:00,760
Calm down.

22
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,760
Let's try again.

23
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,280
Move!

24
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,920
If your man

25
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,320
doesn't pay me back today,

26
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,800
I'll report him to the authorities!

27
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:08,720
Move!

28
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:10,520
I'm begging you!

29
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,360
Please don't go!

30
00:02:12,370 --> 00:02:13,520
I'm begging you, please don't go.

31
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,120
He'll beat me to death if I go back!

32
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,440
Please,

33
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:17,560
give me one more chance.

34
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,200
We can try again.

35
00:02:19,210 --> 00:02:19,800
Just one more time.

36
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,960
I promise I'll give you a child.

37
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,600
All right?

38
00:02:21,610 --> 00:02:23,190
- All right? Let's try again.
- Enough!

39
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,240
Move!

40
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,400
No!

41
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:26,480
No!

42
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:27,000
Move!

43
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,400
Give me one more chance!

44
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,960
Please give me one more chance!

45
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:34,200
You owe me an explanation today!

46
00:02:34,660 --> 00:02:39,380
(Zhaoming Office)
Order!

47
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,960
You there before the court,

48
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,240
what grievance brings you here?

49
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,080
Your Honor.

50
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,480
Wang Wen of the Pan family

51
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,690
signed this agreement with me.

52
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:53,320
We agreed

53
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,520
that I would pay ten taels

54
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:55,600
for a term of one year,

55
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,120
and his Qiniang

56
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,760
would bear me a healthy baby boy.

57
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,320
It's been a whole year,

58
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,240
but that woman

59
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,100
hasn't shown
the slightest sign of pregnancy.

60
00:03:03,260 --> 00:03:04,200
Therefore, Your Honor,

61
00:03:04,210 --> 00:03:05,800
I wish to bring a case against Wang Wen

62
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,760
and demand the return of my payment.

63
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:10,240
That woman has also
lived off me for nothing.

64
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,180
Food, clothing, and medicine

65
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,000
have cost me

66
00:03:12,010 --> 00:03:13,280
twenty taels of silver in total.

67
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,880
This is

68
00:03:15,110 --> 00:03:16,090
a wife-pawning agreement.

69
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:18,920
Your Honor.

70
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:19,440
I...

71
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:20,360
Silence!

72
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,360
I'll handle this myself.

73
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,360
I can do it.

74
00:03:37,620 --> 00:03:40,100
(Petition)

75
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,880
I understand the case.

76
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,360
Wang Wen.

77
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:45,480
Within five days,

78
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,320
you are ordered to repay Chen Pi

79
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,300
twenty taels of silver
as stated in the agreement.

80
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,280
Thank you, Your Honor.

81
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:52,680
Your Honor.

82
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:53,440
It's

83
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:55,920
my wife's fault she can't bear children.

84
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,920
It has nothing to do with me.

85
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:58,960
Qiniang

86
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,080
is your lawfully wedded wife.

87
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,880
This agreement

88
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,880
states it

89
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,040
plainly in black and white.

90
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:05,750
How can you say
it has nothing to do with you?

91
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,360
Your Honor.

92
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:06,960
She...

93
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:08,480
I...

94
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:10,000
can't make her bear a child.

95
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,160
Insolent wretch!

96
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,960
How dare you question me?

97
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:17,320
You've infuriated me!

98
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,200
You...

99
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:19,440
(Order. Execute)
Me...

100
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:19,920
You...

101
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,360
I didn't, Your Honor!

102
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,960
(Order)
I really didn't!

103
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:23,920
Guards!

104
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,320
Drag Wang Wen away

105
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,520
and give him ten strokes!

106
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:26,980
(Order)

107
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:27,680
Your Honor!

108
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,360
- Yes!
- Yes!

109
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,080
Your Honor!

110
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:29,920
I've been wronged!

111
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,070
- I didn't do anything, Your Honor!
- Move!

112
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,320
I've been wronged!

113
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,440
Your Honor!

114
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,240
Your Honor!

115
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,120
Court dismissed!

116
00:04:45,180 --> 00:04:49,220
(Zhaoming Office)

117
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:10,640
Wen.

118
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,000
Are you all right?

119
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,720
This is all your fault!

120
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,160
You're completely useless!

121
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,000
You can't even bear a child.

122
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,680
What good are you to me?

123
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,040
Let me try again.

124
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,160
Let me try one more time.

125
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:24,960
I'm sure I can...

126
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,920
Then figure it out yourself.

127
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:28,880
If you can't bear a child,

128
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:30,160
don't come back!

129
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,680
I'm telling you,

130
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,440
I don't have the money to pay!

131
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:39,020
(Zhaoming Office)

132
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,160
(It's so late.)

133
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:03,120
(Why is someone kneeling in the street?)

134
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:12,560
What happened?

135
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:17,840
This...

136
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,320
Who did this to you?

137
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,040
I'm a legal advocate.

138
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,920
Whatever happened, you can tell me.

139
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:37,860
(Tea)

140
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,280
My name is Jiang Xiaobai.

141
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,480
Can you tell me your name?

142
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,400
May I take a look

143
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,000
at the wound on your hand?

144
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,240
Young Lady.

145
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,840
I'll get some wound medicine.

146
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,560
It's just the two of us now.

147
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,240
Can you tell me

148
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,600
what exactly happened?

149
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,360
I couldn't bear a child.

150
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,400
So your husband beat you?

151
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,560
No.

152
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,400
Then how did you hurt your hand?

153
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,640
My husband pawned me to Chen Pi.

154
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:30,120
Pawned you?

155
00:07:33,780 --> 00:07:36,420
(Pawnbroker: Chen Pi)

156
00:07:36,420 --> 00:07:38,900
(Husband: Wang Wen)

157
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,040
Master Chen.

158
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,880
Look,

159
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,280
the agreement has been signed,

160
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,630
and the fingerprints have been stamped.

161
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:45,760
From now on,

162
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:46,640
my wife

163
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:48,240
is yours.

164
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,320
I guarantee she'll

165
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,720
bear you a healthy baby boy
within a year.

166
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,440
Master Chen.

167
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,440
For

168
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,160
the payment...

169
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,200
Ten taels of silver.

170
00:07:58,200 --> 00:07:58,880
It's all here.

171
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,360
Thank you, Master Chen.

172
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,280
What are you waiting for?

173
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:07,240
Hurry and help
Master Chen inside to rest.

174
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:18,000
Listen carefully.

175
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:20,080
If you don't serve Master Chen well,

176
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,400
I'll beat you to death today.

177
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,280
Do you hear me?

178
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,320
Master Chen.

179
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,320
After you.

180
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,160
Move.

181
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:32,960
Go!

182
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,440
Hurry up!

183
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,760
Stop arguing with me.

184
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:37,760
Get inside!

185
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,240
Master Chen.

186
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:41,560
Enjoy yourself.

187
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,800
So this man named Chen Pi

188
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,000
beat you because you didn't

189
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,120
bear him a child?

190
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,240
Don't worry.

191
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,960
You're safe here.

192
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,320
This is the place.

193
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,280
(Guaranteed Win)

194
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:10,080
This is it.

195
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:12,880
Let's go.

196
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:15,560
No.

197
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,720
I have to go back and bear him a child.

198
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,120
What did you say?

199
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,680
Tell your mother to come out!

200
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,280
Mother.

201
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,480
Qiao'er.

202
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:28,680
Qiao'er!

203
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,120
Qiao'er!

204
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:32,680
Mother!

205
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,680
You wretched woman!
How dare you run away!

206
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:36,000
Try laying a hand on her!

207
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:38,690
You have no right to cause trouble
outside my legal house.

208
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:40,920
Who are you?

209
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:42,280
What?

210
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,120
She's my woman.

211
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,560
I'll hit her if I want to.

212
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,200
It's all right.

213
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,560
It's all right.

214
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,520
Qiniang.

215
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,480
You can stay here

216
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,440
with your child.

217
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:01,240
You don't have to go back with him.

218
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,000
Let's go.

219
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,240
See that?

220
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,080
This is our family business.

221
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:21,200
Who asked you to meddle in our business?

222
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,400
Who do you think you are?

223
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,280
He Dang.

224
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:33,460
What does pawning a wife mean?

225
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:35,560
It means

226
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,600
a man rents his own wife

227
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,640
to another man.

228
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,440
Isn't that against the law?

229
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,150
From ancient times to the present,

230
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:42,560
even under the laws of our dynasty,

231
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:43,760
this has always been the case.

232
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:46,960
Come on.

233
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:51,720
Over there.

234
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,080
Stay there.

235
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:54,440
Master Chen!

236
00:10:54,940 --> 00:10:56,160
Master Chen, open the door!

237
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,650
I've brought her back to you!

238
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,160
What's all that noise?

239
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:00,800
Master Chen.

240
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,200
Well.

241
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,440
I've been looking for you.

242
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,730
And you dare show your face here?

243
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:05,760
Pay me back!

244
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,000
Now!

245
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,120
Master Chen.

246
00:11:08,220 --> 00:11:08,920
Please calm down.

247
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:09,720
Calm down.

248
00:11:10,280 --> 00:11:12,040
I really don't have the money.

249
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,240
Why don't you

250
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,760
try with my wife one more time?

251
00:11:14,860 --> 00:11:16,110
Get out of here!

252
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,560
What I want is a son!

253
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:21,080
Your wife can't even bear a child.

254
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:21,880
Bah!

255
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,560
She's nothing but bad luck.

256
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,280
No.

257
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:26,280
Just tell me, are you
paying me back or not?

258
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,240
Are you?

259
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,080
If you won't,

260
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,290
I'll report you to the authorities!

261
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:33,800
Let go of my daughter!

262
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:34,600
Get out of the way!

263
00:11:34,610 --> 00:11:35,280
- What are you doing?
- Mother!

264
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:35,880
Get out of the way!

265
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:41,120
What are you doing?

266
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:42,280
Mother!

267
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,160
Qiao'er, run!

268
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:45,880
- You'll pay for this!
- You little brat!

269
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,360
You're asking for it!

270
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,840
Mother.

271
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,440
When I grow up,

272
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:59,320
will I be pawned off to bear children
for someone else too?

273
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:00,840
No.

274
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,640
Mother.

275
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:08,280
I'm cold.

276
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:12,840
Get some sleep.

277
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,960
You won't feel cold once you're asleep.

278
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:23,960
(Qiao'er.)

279
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:25,960
(I'm sorry.)

280
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:30,740
(Guaranteed Win)

281
00:12:34,100 --> 00:12:34,920
Pawning a wife means

282
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:35,960
a man rents his own wife

283
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,000
to another man.

284
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,920
From ancient times to the present,

285
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,360
even under the laws of our dynasty,

286
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,580
this has always been the case.

287
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,040
Miss Jiang!

288
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,240
Miss Jiang!

289
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,600
What is it?

290
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:48,200
Qiniang is dead.

291
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,040
What?

292
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:59,000
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

293
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:02,360
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

294
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,760
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

295
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:07,680
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

296
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,560
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

297
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:16,240
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

298
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,400
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

299
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:21,880
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

300
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:27,520
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

301
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:31,120
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

302
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:34,160
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

303
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:38,200
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

304
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:41,480
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

305
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:44,560
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

306
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:47,280
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

307
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:50,520
♪I'll only say that once♪

308
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,760
♪I called your name♪

309
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:59,600
♪The silent stars hang low♪

310
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,200
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

311
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,360
♪I linger in the old tower♪

312
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:10,120
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

313
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:13,880
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

314
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:17,560
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

315
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:20,560
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

316
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:26,800
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

317
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:29,960
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

318
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:34,040
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

319
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:36,680
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

320
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:40,960
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

321
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:43,880
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

322
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:47,040
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

323
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:49,720
♪If we meet again in another life♪

324
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:52,760
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

325
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:55,720
♪Was when we first met?♪

326
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,400
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

327
00:15:00,520 --> 00:15:02,280
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
